.TH FL-LAUNCHER 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.0" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-launcher \- application menu of the fldesktop desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-launcher\fR [\fB\-\-daemon\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A searchable list of the installed applications, grouped by category. Type to
search, Enter starts the selected application (or runs the text as a command when nothing
matches), Escape closes. Starting it while it is open closes it.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-daemon\fR
Keep the launcher ready, hidden, and show or hide it on \fBSIGUSR1\fR, so
that it opens at once. The session starts it
(\fI/etc/xdg/autostart/fl-launcher.desktop\fR); \fBfl-wm\fR(1)'s
Super+Space and the panel's button then signal it, and start
\fBfl-launcher\fR as before when it is not running. It starts again by
itself when the appearance changes.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-wm\fR(1), \fBfl-session\fR(1), \fBfl-panel\fR(1)
